---
title: Credential vault (encryption at rest)
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Admin
  participant API as apps/api (vault)
  participant K as Key (env / KMS)
  participant DB as organization_credential (RLS)
  A->>API: save provider secret
  API->>K: derive data key
  API->>API: AES-256-GCM encrypt (per-row nonce)
  API->>DB: store ciphertext (org-bound)
  Note over API,DB: plaintext never logged
  A->>API: view
  API-->>A: masked value
  A->>API: rotate
  API->>DB: re-encrypt (zero-downtime)
